<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Seven Wonders of the World</title>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>Seven Wonders of the World</h1>

    <p>
        The <strong>Seven Wonders of the World</strong> are some of the most
        amazing and famous landmarks on Earth. They show the <em>history,
        culture, and creativity</em> of different civilizations.
    </p>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>1. Great Wall of China</h2>

        <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1508804185872-d7badad00f7d"
            alt="Great Wall of China"
            width="300"
            height="200"
        >

        <p>
            The Great Wall of China is a historic wall built to protect
            ancient Chinese states and empires.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>2. Petra</h2>

        <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548786811-dd6e453ccca7"
            alt="Petra in Jordan"
            width="300"
            height="200"
        >

        <p>
            Petra is an ancient city in Jordan famous for its buildings
            carved directly into the rock.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>3. Colosseum</h2>

        <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552832230-c0197dd311b5"
            alt="Colosseum in Rome"
            width="300"
            height="200"
        >

        <p>
            The Colosseum is a famous ancient amphitheater in Rome, Italy.
            It was used for public shows and events.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>4. Chichén Itzá</h2>

        <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518638150340-f706e86654de"
            alt="Chichen Itza"
            width="300"
            height="200"
        >

        <p>
            Chichén Itzá is an ancient Mayan city in Mexico known for its
            impressive pyramids and architecture.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>5. Machu Picchu</h2>

        <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526392060635-9d6019884377"
            alt="Machu Picchu in Peru"
            width="300"
            height="200"
        >

        <p>
            Machu Picchu is an ancient Inca site located high in the
            mountains of Peru.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>6. Taj Mahal</h2>

        <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564507592333-c60657eea523"
            alt="Taj Mahal in India"
            width="300"
            height="200"
        >

        <p>
            The Taj Mahal is a beautiful white marble monument in India.
            It is famous for its <em>architecture and history</em>.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>7. Christ the Redeemer</h2>

        <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1483729558449-99ef09a8c325"
            alt="Christ the Redeemer in Rio de Janeiro"
            width="300"
            height="200"
        >

        <p>
            Christ the Redeemer is a famous statue overlooking Rio de
            Janeiro, Brazil.
        </p>
    </div>

    <p>
        <a href="https://world.new7wonders.com/"
        target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
           Click here to Learn more about the Seven Wonders 
        </a>
    </p>

    <footer>
        <p>Seven Wonders of the World</p>
    </footer>

</body>

</html>
